# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate a 127-qubit kicked-Ising model for the latest version of Pauli propagation"
msgstr "Simulasikan model kicked-Ising 127-qubit untuk versi terbaru Pauli propagation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate a 127-qubit kicked-Ising model"
msgstr "Simulasikan model kicked-Ising 127-qubit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/pauli-prop/guides/simulate-127-q-kicked-ising.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide we use the ``pauli-prop`` package to classically simulate the time dynamics of a 127-qubit kicked-Ising model on a heavy-hex lattice and approximate the single-site magnetization, $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$. The Hamiltonian considered is:\n"
msgstr "Di panduan ini kita pakai paket ``pauli-prop`` untuk mensimulasikan secara klasik dinamika waktu model kicked-Ising 127-qubit pada kisi heavy-hex dan mengaproksimasi magnetisasi satu situs, $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$. Hamiltonian yang dipakai adalah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"
msgstr "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $J>0$ describes the coupling of nearest-neighbor spins, $i<j$, and $h$ is the global transverse field. A first-order Trotter decomposition of the time-evolved operator will be implemented as a quantum circuit, $U$, over $20$ Trotter steps. The coupling constant, $J$, will be fixed at $J=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ such that $U$ is Clifford any time $h\\mod\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$.\n"
msgstr "dengan $J>0$ menggambarkan kopling antar spin tetangga terdekat, $i<j$, dan $h$ adalah medan transversal global. Dekomposisi Trotter orde pertama dari operator yang berevolusi waktu akan diimplementasikan sebagai circuit kuantum, $U$, selama $20$ langkah Trotter. Konstanta kopling, $J$, akan dibuat tetap di $J=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ sehingga $U$ adalah Clifford kapan pun $h\\mod\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow:\n"
msgstr "Alur kerja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create quantum circuits implementing the Trotterized Ising model\n"
msgstr "Buat circuit kuantum yang mengimplementasikan model Ising Trotter\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Vary $h$ between Clifford points, $0.0$ and $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n"
msgstr "Variasikan $h$ di antara titik-titik Clifford, $0.0$ dan $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a site in the middle of the lattice (qubit $62$) and estimate the magnetization after $20$ Trotter steps for each circuit\n"
msgstr "Pilih satu situs di tengah kisi (qubit $62$) dan estimasi magnetisasi setelah $20$ langkah Trotter untuk setiap circuit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe the magnetization roll off from $1.0$ to $0.0$ as $h$ moves from one Clifford point to another\n"
msgstr "Amati magnetisasi turun dari $1.0$ ke $0.0$ saat $h$ bergerak dari satu titik Clifford ke titik Clifford lainnya\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create circuits {#create-circuits}"
msgstr "Buat circuit {#create-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we use ``FakeSherbrooke`` from ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` to get the edge indices for the coupling map of the 127-qubit Eagle QPU. Once we have the edge indices, we create the Trotter circuits for the varying values of $h$ we want to simulate. The circuits will implement a first-order Trotterization of the Hamiltonian using 20 Trotter steps and 5420 gates.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, kita pakai ``FakeSherbrooke`` dari ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` untuk mendapatkan indeks edge dari coupling map QPU Eagle 127-qubit. Setelah punya indeks edge, kita buat circuit Trotter untuk berbagai nilai $h$ yang ingin kita simulasikan. Circuit ini mengimplementasikan Trotterisasi orde pertama dari Hamiltonian memakai 20 langkah Trotter dan 5420 gate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate the time dynamics with Pauli propagation {#simulate-the-time-dynamics-with-pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Simulasikan dinamika waktu dengan Pauli propagation {#simulate-the-time-dynamics-with-pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, we specify the observable, $O$, we want to measure. In this case, we estimate $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, kita tentukan observable, $O$, yang ingin diukur. Dalam kasus ini, kita mengestimasi $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To study the magnetization between Clifford points, we approximately propagate $O$ to the beginning of the circuit, $U$, resulting in a new observable, $O^\\prime \\approx U^{\\dagger}OU$.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mempelajari magnetisasi di antara titik-titik Clifford, kita mempropagasikan $O$ secara aproksimasi ke awal circuit, $U$, sehingga menghasilkan observable baru, $O^\\prime \\approx U^{\\dagger}OU$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"During propagation, the number of terms in the evolved observable grows exponentially in the number of gates, so it is usually necessary to limit how large it can grow. Here, we limit the number of terms in $O^\\prime$ to $10^5$ and truncate terms with coefficients smaller than $10^{-5}$. Truncating terms results in some error.\n"
"Once we have $O^\\prime$, we can easily estimate the expectation value, $\\langle0|U^{\\dagger}OU|0\\rangle = \\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle$, by summing the coefficients of the diagonal terms in $O^\\prime$ (terms consisting only of ``I`` or ``Z`` on all qubits).\n"
msgstr ""
"Selama propagasi, jumlah suku dalam observable yang berevolusi tumbuh secara eksponensial terhadap jumlah gate, jadi biasanya perlu membatasi seberapa besar ia boleh tumbuh. Di sini, kita membatasi jumlah suku di $O^\\prime$ sampai $10^5$ dan memotong suku dengan koefisien lebih kecil dari $10^{-5}$. Pemotongan suku menimbulkan sedikit error.\n"
"Setelah punya $O^\\prime$, kita bisa dengan mudah mengestimasi nilai ekspektasi, $\\langle0|U^{\\dagger}OU|0\\rangle = \\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle$, dengan menjumlahkan koefisien suku-suku diagonal di $O^\\prime$ (suku yang hanya terdiri dari ``I`` atau ``Z`` pada semua qubit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We set ``frame='h'`` to specify we want to evolve the observable in the Heisenberg framework ($U^{\\dagger}OU$). Use ``frame=s`` for Schrödinger evolution ($UOU^{\\dagger}$).\n"
msgstr "Kita set ``frame='h'`` untuk menentukan bahwa kita ingin mengevolusikan observable dalam kerangka Heisenberg ($U^{\\dagger}OU$). Pakai ``frame=s`` untuk evolusi Schrödinger ($UOU^{\\dagger}$).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize {#visualize}"
msgstr "Visualisasi {#visualize}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, we plot the magnetization as a function of $h$. When $h=0$, the circuit does not affect the initial state in the computational basis, and we know $\\langle0|O|0\\rangle = 1.0$. As $h$ moves further from $0$, the magnetization decays monotonically until $h$ reaches the next Clifford angle, $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, and the magnetization converges to $0$.\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, kita plot magnetisasi sebagai fungsi dari $h$. Saat $h=0$, circuit tidak memengaruhi keadaan awal dalam basis komputasi, dan kita tahu $\\langle0|O|0\\rangle = 1.0$. Saat $h$ bergerak menjauh dari $0$, magnetisasi meluruh secara monoton sampai $h$ mencapai sudut Clifford berikutnya, $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, dan magnetisasi konvergen ke $0$.\n"

